# NCAAF /drives FanDuel odds

FanDuel drive-result prices are **not** scraped from sbapi/fdx. `scripts/watch_fanduel_drive_results.mjs` upserts Neon from the Android emulator; `/api/ncaaf-drives` trusts `fd_drive_odds` for FD and still fetches DK 1st-drive live.

Do **not** re-seed fake SMU @ Florida State rows. Ended games should be deleted from `fd_drive_odds`, not left to rot.

## Writer contract

One row per game + side + drive (`drive_n = 1` for opening drive). Unique `(home_team, away_team, offense_side, drive_n)`.

```sql
INSERT INTO fd_drive_odds (
  event_id, home_team, away_team, kickoff_at,
  offense_side, offense_name, drive_n, market_name,
  td_american, fg_american, punt_american, other_american
) VALUES (...)
ON CONFLICT (home_team, away_team, offense_side, drive_n) DO UPDATE SET
  event_id = EXCLUDED.event_id,
  offense_name = EXCLUDED.offense_name,
  market_name = EXCLUDED.market_name,
  td_american = EXCLUDED.td_american,
  fg_american = EXCLUDED.fg_american,
  punt_american = EXCLUDED.punt_american,
  other_american = EXCLUDED.other_american,
  fetched_at = now();
```

Match games by `event_id` first, then team names. Merge FD + DK onto the same card (`outcomes.*.fd` / `outcomes.*.dk`). Dual-book rows put the model line under the FD/DK boxes (`.drives-line-model`).
